Holodor provenance: VERBATIM from ROCKNIX distribution f3e2b6187c,
projects/ROCKNIX/devices/SM8250/patches/linux/9998-gpu-tuning.patch (via ArmadaOS 5915c28,
packages/kernel/patches/9998-sm8250-gpu-tuning.patch, which ships it on the RP5).
Replaces our older 9998-gpu-opp-table.patch (the pre-2026-08-02 ROCKNIX table: 650-800 MHz
at NOM_L1, no ACD, no gfx-mem bandwidth votes). Added 2026-10-02 as the Armada-parity test
for the RP5 DXVK freeze and stutter. TODO: check every level against the RP5 vendor DT.

GPU tuning for SM8250: frequency ladder, ACD, and memory bandwidth.


1. Overclock and use KonaBess frequency lader
Matches speedbin extracted from stock firmware and included extra steps in the
ladder that are exposed in android by KonaBess mod.


2. Enalbe ACD
Enable ACD it was not enabled before. 


3. Allow voting for memory bandwidth
Matches stock memory bandwith votes. 

Idle voted at higher bandwidth now may have negative effect
on battery life. 

